<title>USA: Elscint Q3 share declines to $0.01.</title>
<headline>Elscint Q3 share declines to $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.01		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net		 101			3,756</p>
<p> Revs		78,046		   73,304</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  15,915		   16,051</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.41		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net		 6,636		    10,817</p>
<p> Revs		226,161		  200,772</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  16,009		   15,955</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Elscint Limited</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share for 1995 periods have been restated to reflect one-for-five reverse stock split in March 1996.</p>
<p>The company said equipment sales in the third quarter were hurt by substantial declines in selling prices, mainly in Europe. It said this factor and high introductory costs associated with making large quantities on a new camera, hurt gross margins.</p>
